    "html": "<ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.hasil.gov.my/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">Lembaga Hasil Dalam Negeri (LHDN Malaysia)</a> — Official Portal &amp; Guidelines on Foreign-Sourced Income</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://mytax.hasil.gov.my/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">MyTax Portal (LHDN)</a> — Annual Electronic Tax Filing (Form BE / B)</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.treasury.gov.my/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">Ministry of Finance Malaysia</a> — Finance Act Updates &amp; Gazette Exemption Orders</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-3\">Always verify foreign tax receipts and maintain cross-border bank statements for at least 7 years in compliance with LHDN recordkeeping statutes.</p>"
